tion des Marchés Publics)" "Confirmation the candidate (and its dirigeants) is not on ARMP's published exclusion list ('liste noire'), Loi n°10/010 Art. 80/81" "INSS (Institut National de la Sécurité Sociale) good-standing confirmation, Loi n°10/010 Art. 23(a) 'situation vis-à-vis des... organismes de protection sociale'" "Authorized-representative confirmation record"], :permit/ns "marketentry", :permit/repo "orgs/cloud-itonami/cloud-itonami-iso3166-cod", :permit/legal-basis "Loi n°10/010 du 27 avril 2010 relative aux marchés publics -- Art. 13 (contrôle a priori assigned to a service under the ministry in charge of the budget, i.e. DGCMP) + Art. 14 (creates ARMP, the ex-post regulatory institution) + Art. 84 (abrogates the prior Ordonnance-loi n°69-054 du 5 décembre 1969)", :permit/citations "{\"corporate-number\" {\"legal-basis\" \"Décret n°17/2003 du 2 mars 2003 portant création de la Direction Générale des Impôts, modifié par le Décret n°22/52 du 30 décembre 2022 -- DGI operates under the Ministère des Finances with administrative and financial autonomy and issues the Numéro d'Identification Fiscale (NIF); DGI's own site states 'Le Numéro d'Identification Fiscale est indispensable pour toute activité économique'. This iteration did NOT independently verify the specific law/decree creating the NIF obligation itself (an honest gap, see namespace docstring)\", \"provenance\" \"https://dgi.gouv.cd/ ; https://dgi.gouv.cd/a-propos/ ; https://e-nif.dgirdc.cd/\", \"owner-authority\" \"Direction Générale des Impôts (DGI)\"}, \"rep\" {\"provenance\" \"https://armp-rdc.cd/wp-content/uploads/2021/12/Lois-relative-aux-marchs-publicsx.pdf\", \"owner-authority\" \"Autorité de Régulation des Marchés Publics (ARMP) -- Loi n°10/010's own Art. 23(a) qualification criteria\", \"legal-basis\" \"Loi n°10/010 du 27 avril 2010, Art. 23(a): candidate qualification criteria include 'l'absence de disqualification ou de condamnation de l'entreprise candidate ou DE SES DIRIGEANTS liée à la passation des marchés publics ou à leur activité professionnelle' -- extends disqualification/conviction grounds to the CANDIDATE'S OWN DIRECTORS/OFFICERS, a DIFFERENT scope than Benin's Art. 61/62 (which extends instead to consortium members and subcontractors, not the bidder's own officers)\"}, \"business-registration\" {\"provenance\" \"https://www.leganet.cd/Legislation/Droit%20Public/EPub/AM.35.04.03.2013.htm\", \"legal-basis\" \"Décret n°12/045 du 1er novembre 2012 portant création, organisation et fonctionnement d'un Guichet Unique de Création d'Entreprise; procedures fixed by Arrêté ministériel n°035/CAB/MIN/J&DH/2013 du 4 mars 2013 (Ministre de la Justice et Droits Humains) -- own primary text: Art. 3 (RCCM immatriculation/inscription modificative within a statutory maximum of 3 business days from a complete file); Art. 20 (GUCE registration data transmitted to DGI, l'Office National de l'Emploi, l'Inscription générale du Travail, l'Institut National de la Sécurité Sociale (INSS) and l'Agence Nationale de Promotion des Investissements (ANAPI), among others)\", \"owner-authority\" \"Guichet Unique de Création d'Entreprise (GUCE) -- RCCM immatriculation is executed by a Notaire (authentication) + Greffier divisionnaire (immatriculation), both judicial officers, per OHADA's Acte Uniforme relatif au Droit Commercial Général\"}, \"national-regional-preference\" {\"provenance\" \"https://armp-rdc.cd/wp-content/uploads/2021/12/Lois-relative-aux-marchs-publicsx.pdf\", \"owner-authority\" \"Autorité de Régulation des Marchés Publics (ARMP) -- the Code's regulator; the abattement's magnitude is applied and quantified by each autorité contractante, per tender, in the cahier des charges\", \"legal-basis\" \"Loi n°10/010 du 27 avril 2010, Section 5 ('De la préférence nationale et régionale'), Art. 37: a 6-tier ranked bid-evaluation preference (abattement sur l'offre financière) applied in priority order to (1) a Congolese natural person, (2) a Congolese SME majority-owned by Congolese persons, (3) a Congolese legal person, (4) groupings with Congolese participation/subcontracting, (5) a foreign entity with Congolese economic activity, (6) a foreign entity from a treaty-preference State -- the RANKING is fixed by the law's own text; the abattement's magnitude is discretionary, 'indiquée et quantifiée dans l'appel d'offres' (NOT modeled here, the same honest scope-narrowing Benin's catalog applied to its own Art. 77 discretionary branch)\"}}", :permit/jurisdiction "COD", :source/dataset "permits", :permit/provenance ["https://armp-rdc.cd/wp-content/uploads/2021/12/Lois-relative-aux-marchs-publicsx.pdf"], :permit/authority "Autorité de Régulation des Marchés Publics (ARMP) -- the ex-post regulatory institution created under Loi n°10/010 Art. 14 ('institution chargée notamment du contrôle a posteriori des marchés publics... de l'audit, de la formation et de renforcement des capacités'), organized by décret du Premier ministre, operating under the Primature (Prime Minister's office)", :permit/subject-key "COD", :permit/subject-name "Democratic Republic of the Congo", :permit/national-spec "marche.armp-rdc.cd -- a live e-procurement notice portal (calls for tender, provisional/definitive awards, infructuosité declarations across 60+ contracting authorities), operated DIRECTLY by ARMP itself (a DIFFERENT institutional shape from Benin, where the portal is operated by a body SEPARATE from the regulator). Ex-ante procedural control ('contrôle a priori') is separately performed by the Direction Générale de Contrôle des Marchés Publics (DGCMP, dgcmp.cd), per Art. 13"} {:permit/source-shape :requirement-map, :permit/required-evidence ["EIN record" "SAM.gov registration record" "State business registration record" "Authorized-representative record"], :permit/ns "marketentry", :permit/repo "orgs/cloud-itonami/cloud-itonami-iso3166-cod", :permit/legal-basis "Federal Acquisition Regulation (FAR); System for Award Management", :permit/jurisdiction "USA", :source/dataset "permits", :permit/provenance ["https://sam.gov/"], :permit/authority "U.S. General Services Administration (GSA) / SAM.gov", :permit/subject-key "USA", :permit/subject-name "United States", :permit/national-spec "SAM.gov entity registration + NAICS self-certification"} {:permit/source-shape :requirement-map, :permit/required-evidence ["Handelsregister extract" "e-Vergabe registration record" "USt-IdNr record" "Authorized-representative record"], :permit/ns "marketentry", :permit/repo "orgs/cloud-itonami/cloud-itonami-iso3166-cod", :permit/legal-basis "Gesetz gegen Wettbewerbsbeschränkungen (GWB) / VgV", :permit/jurisdiction "DEU", :source/dataset "permits", :permit/provenance ["https://www.evergabe-online.de/"], :permit/authority "Beschaffungsamt des BMI / e-Vergabe platforms", :permit/subject-key "DEU", :permit/subject-name "Germany", :permit/national-spec "e-Vergabe supplier registration under EU procurement directives"} {:permit/source-shape :requirement-map, :permit/required-evidence ["RCCM registration record (Registre du Commerce et du Crédit Mobilier -- OHADA Acte Uniforme relatif au Droit Commercial Général (AUDCG) Art. 44(1)/46(1); intake centralized through the Agence Congolaise pour la Création des Entreprises (ACPCE) guichet unique, Loi n° 16-2017 du 30 mars 2017 + Décret n° 2017-522 de décembre 2017)" "NIU record (Numéro d'Identifiant Unique -- Direction Générale des Impôts et des Domaines (DGID), Ministère des Finances, du Budget et du Portefeuille Public; self-service NIU verification and télé-déclaration via the Portail Fiscal Officiel, impots.gouv.cg/portail-client-web)" "ARMP exclusion-list confirmation (Décret n° 2009-156 Art. 146 -- operator, and any majority-capital parent/subsidiary company, not on ARMP's published exclusion list)" "BOAMP/ARMP tender-participation registration record" "Authorized-representative confirmation record"], :permit/ns "marketentry", :permit/repo "orgs/cloud-itonami/cloud-itonami-iso3166-cog", :permit/legal-basis "Décret n° 2009-156 du 20 mai 2009 portant Code des Marchés Publics -- Art. 20 (creates ARMP, instituted under the Presidency, independent a posteriori regulation) + Art. 21 (missions: audits, exclusion-list maintenance, official procurement bulletin) + Art. 146 (candidate/bidder sanctions, incl. exclusion)", :permit/citations "{\"corporate-number\" {\"legal-basis\" \"DGID, under the Ministère des Finances, du Budget et du Portefeuille Public (MFBPP), issues the Numéro d'Identifiant Unique (NIU); a live self-service télé-déclaration/NIU-verification portal operates at impots.gouv.cg/portail-client-web ('Portail Fiscal Officiel de La République du Congo', Version 3.0.1 du 17/11/2020) even though DGID's own general public-information site (impots.cg) was 'Site en Construction' as of this iteration's retrieval. This iteration did NOT find a specific decree/law number establishing DGID or the NIU requirement itself -- an honest gap, unlike Benin's Décret N°2006-201 for the IFU\", \"provenance\" \"https://www.impots.cg/ ; https://impots.gouv.cg/portail-client-web/\", \"owner-authority\" \"Direction Générale des Impôts et des Domaines (DGID)\"}, \"exclusion-cap\" {\"owner-authority\" \"Autorité de Régulation des Marchés Publics (ARMP)\", \"legal-basis\" \"Décret n° 2009-156 du 20 mai 2009, Art. 146: exclusion from competition for a duration set according to the gravity of the fault (collusion, bid-splitting fraud, over/false invoicing, improper influence on evaluation/award, court-confirmed prior contractual breach, false/misleading declarations), extending to majority-capital parent/subsidiary companies for a collusion finding. Own text verbatim: 'La décision d'exclusion de la commande publique ne peut dépasser cinq ans. En cas de renouvellement des atteintes à la réglementation des marchés publics par la même personne physique ou morale, une décision d'exclusion définitive peut être prononcée par les juridictions compétentes.' ARMP itself maintains and publishes an updated exclusion list (own text: 'établit périodiquement une liste des personnes physiques et morales exclues... publiée sur le site internet de ladite autorité')\", \"provenance\" \"https://sgg.cg/codes/congo-code-2009-marches-publics.pdf ; https://www.armp.cg/disputes-excluded.php?lang=fr\"}, \"hydrocarbons-local-content\" {\"legal-basis\" \"Executive order of 15 November 2019 (hydrocarbons sector only): foreign firms in petroleum must joint-venture with the Société Nationale des Pétroles du Congo (SNPC) and staff 80% of management positions and 90% of all positions with Congolese nationals\", \"owner-authority\" \"Government of the Republic of the Congo (executive order, hydrocarbons/petroleum sector only -- not ARMP, not a general public-procurement rule)\", \"provenance\" \"https://www.state.gov/reports/2022-investment-climate-statements/republic-of-the-congo\"}, \"business-registration\" {\"provenance\" \"https://acpce.cg/ ; https://acpce.cg/missions/ ; https://acpce.cg/creer-une-societe/\", \"legal-basis\" \"Loi n° 16-2017 du 30 mars 2017 (creates ACPCE) + Décret n° 2017-522 de décembre 2017 (approves its statutes) -- ACPCE is an Établissement Public à caractère Administratif under the ministry in charge of SMEs. ACPCE's own 'Créer une société' filing checklist names RCCM and NIU as required reference documents but does not itself state whether ACPCE performs RCCM registration or forwards it to a Tribunal de Commerce's greffe (OHADA AUDCG's own designated registering body) -- this iteration separately fetched Congo's Ministry of Justice site (justice.gouv.cg) directly and found no page naming a specific Tribunal de Commerce for RCCM, an honest, explicitly-flagged gap\", \"owner-authority\" \"Agence Congolaise pour la Création des Entreprises (ACPCE) -- the guichet unique for business-creation formalities\"}}", :permit/jurisdiction "COG", :source/dataset "permits", :permit/provenance ["https://sgg.cg/codes/congo-code-2009-marches-publics.pdf"], :permit/authority "Autorité de Régulation des Marchés Publics (ARMP) -- an independent regulatory body instituted under the Presidency of the Republic (Décret n° 2009-156 du 20 mai 2009, Art. 20)", :permit/subject-key "COG", :permit/subject-name "Republic of the Congo", :permit/national-spec "Direction Générale du Contrôle des Marchés Publics (DGCMP), housed within the ministry in charge of finances (Code Art. 17 §2; Décret n° 2009-159 du 20 mai 2009 fixes its own organization) -- performs a priori control of the procurement PROCEDURE, a body DIFFERENT from ARMP. Tender notices are published via ARMP's own paid BOAMP bulletin purchase/subscription system (armp.cg/services-portal.php) -- NOT a live self-service e-tendering portal; a digitalization decree exists (Décret n° 2024-2072 du 10 octobre 2024) but ARMP's own 'Dématérialisation des procédures' page shows 'Bientôt disponible' (coming soon) as of this iteration's retrieval"} {:permit/source-shape :requirement-map, :permit/required-evidence ["EIN record" "SAM.gov registration record" "State business registration record" "Authorized-representative record"], :permit/ns "marketentry", :permit/repo "orgs/cloud-itonami/cloud-itonami-iso3166-cog", :permit/legal-basis "Federal Acquisition Regulation (FAR); System for Award Management", :permit/jurisdiction "USA", :source/dataset "permits", :permit/provenance ["https://sam.gov/"], :permit/authority "U.S. General Services Administration (GSA) / SAM.gov", :permit/subject-key "USA", :permit/subject-name "United States", :permit/national-spec "SAM.gov entity registration + NAICS self-certification"} {:permit/source-shape :requirement-map, :permit/required-evidence ["Handelsregister extract" "e-Vergabe registration record" "USt-IdNr record" "Authorized-representative record"], :permit/ns "marketentry", :permit/repo "orgs/cloud-itonami/cloud-itonami-iso3166-cog", :permit/legal-basis "Gesetz gegen Wettbewerbsbeschränkungen (GWB) / VgV", :permit/jurisdiction "DEU", :source/dataset "permits", :permit/provenance ["https://www.evergabe-online.de/"], :permit/authority "Beschaffungsamt des BMI / e-Vergabe platforms", :permit/subject-key "DEU", :permit/subject-name "Germany", :permit/national-spec "e-Vergabe supplier registration under EU procurement directives"} {:permit/source-shape :requirement-map, :permit/required-evidence ["NIT record" "SECOP II registration record" "RUES extract" "Authorized-representative record"], :permit/ns "marketentry", :permit/repo "orgs/cloud-itonami/cloud-itonami-iso3166-col", :permit/legal-basis "Ley 80/1993; Decreto 1082/2015", :permit/citations "{\"corporate-number\" {\"legal-basis\" \"NIT\", \"provenance\" \"https://www.dian.gov.co/\", \"owner-authority\" \"DIAN / RUES\"}, \"rep\" {\"provenance\" \"https://www.colombiacompra.gov.co/\", \"owner-authority\" \"contracting authorities / CCE\", \"legal-basis\" \"Colombian legal entity (NIT) typically required for SECOP awards\"}}", :permit/jurisdiction "COL", :source/dataset "permits", :permit/provenance ["https://www.colombiacompra.gov.co/"], :permit/authority "Colombia Compra Eficiente / SECOP II", :permit/subject-key "COL", :permit/subject-name "Colombia", :permit/national-spec "SECOP II supplier registration + NIT"} {:permit/source-shape :requirement-map, :permit/required-evidence ["Certificat d'immatriculation au registre du commerce et du crédit mobilier (RCCM), délivré par le Tribunal de Commerce (OHADA Acte uniforme révisé relatif au droit des sociétés commerciales et du GIE, 2014)" "Carte du contribuable, Administration Générale des Impôts et des Domaines (AGID), Loi n°12-004/AU" "Carte de patente (AGID / Bureau de domaine)" "Confirmation the operator is not subject to a currently-unprescribed ARMP exclusion decision (Code des Marchés Publics 2022 Art.75 7°, sauf prescription de cinq ans)" "Registration/participation record in the Comores Marchés Publics online tender-management system (décret n°23-080/PR du 15 août 2023)" "Confirmation of authorized representative"], :permit/ns "marketentry", :permit/repo "orgs/cloud-itonami/cloud-itonami-iso3166-com", :permit/legal-basis "Code des Marchés Publics 2022 (Loi n°22-011/AU du 23 juin 2022, modifiant et complétant la loi n°11-027/AU du 29 décembre 2011, portant passation des marchés publics et délégation des services publics), promulguée par le décret n°2022-085/PR du 13 octobre 2022 -- Art.19 (création de l'ARMP), Art.16 (création de la DNCMP)", :permit/citations "{\"armp-exclusion\" {\"owner-authority\" \"Autorité de Régulation des Marchés Publics (ARMP), rattachée à la Présidence de l'Union des Comores\", \"legal-basis\" \"Code des Marchés Publics 2022 Art.75 ('Cas d'inéligibilités'), 7°: ineligible to bid a person 'exclu[e] des procédures de passation des marchés ... par une décision de l'Autorité de régulation des marchés publics, sauf prescription de cinq ans'; corroborated by Décret n°25-002/PR du 22 janvier 2025 Art.3(c) (own primary text, viewed directly as a rendered page image): ARMP is empowered 'de dresser une liste noire des entreprises sanctionnées'; the live 'Entreprises exclues' page on armpcomores.km is that same mechanism's public face\", \"provenance\" \"https://armpcomores.km/entreprise-exclus/ ; https://armpcomores.km/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/Comores-Code-2022-marches-publics.pdf ; https://armpcomores.km/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Decret-N%C2%B025-002PR-du-22-jan-2025-Portant-Application-de-certaines-Dispositions-Portant-Passation-des-Marches-Publics-.pdf\"}, \"corporate-number\" {\"legal-basis\" \"Loi N°12-004/AU relative à la création de l'AGID, adoptée le 21 juin 2012, promulguée le 2 août 2012 -- Art.2 (own primary text as fetched from AGID's own site): competence over direct/indirect taxes, registration rights, stamp duties, AND state domain/land/cadastre (hence 'et des Domaines'). Registration outputs: carte du contribuable, carte de patente\", \"provenance\" \"https://dgi.gouv.km/fr/historique.php ; https://dgi.gouv.km/fr/mission.php ; https://finances.gouv.km/\", \"owner-authority\" \"Administration Générale des Impôts et des Domaines (AGID), Ministère des Finances\"}, \"business-registration\" {\"provenance\" \"https://eregulations.investcomoros.net/procedure/37?l=fr ; https://anpicomores.com/fr ; https://www.investcomoros.net/les-procedures-de-creation-dentreprises-aux-comores/\", \"legal-basis\" \"OHADA Acte uniforme portant sur le droit commercial général (own cited articles: 44, 46) and OHADA Acte Uniforme révisé relatif au droit des sociétés commerciales et du groupement d'intérêt économique (2014) (own cited articles: 45, 65-66, 311 [SARL minimum capital 1 000 000 FCFA], 387 [SA minimum capital 10 000 000 FCFA]) -- directly applicable, Comoros IS a ratified OHADA member state (ratified 20 October 1995, entry into force 3 December 1996, per OHADA's own member-states page; see namespace docstring correction). Also: Arrêté interministériel du 11 juin 2019 (modifiant l'arrêté interministériel du 25 octobre 2012) fixant les modalités d'enregistrement des déclarations d'activités des entreprises (own cited articles: 10, 11, per ANPI's own database, not independently fetched by this iteration)\", \"owner-authority\" \"Agence Nationale pour la Promotion des Investissements (ANPI) -- guichet unique for company creation; RCCM certificate itself issued by the Tribunal de Commerce\"}}", :permit/jurisdiction "COM", :source/dataset "permits", :permit/provenance ["https://armpcomores.km/" "https://armpcomores.km/codes-de-marches-publics/" "https://armpcomores.km/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/Comores-Code-2022-marches-publics.pdf" "https://finances.gouv.km/"], :permit/authority "Autorité de Régulation des Marchés Publics (ARMP), rattachée à la Présidence de l'Union des Comores -- Direction Nationale de Contrôle des Marchés Publics et Délégations de Service Public (DNCMP), sous tutelle du Ministre chargé des finances, comme organe de contrôle", :permit/subject-key "COM", :permit/subject-name "Union of the Comoros", :permit/national-spec "Comores Marchés Publics -- système de gestion des appels d'offres en ligne institué par le décret n°23-080/PR du 15 août 2023; ARMP's own site (armpcomores.km) publishes Avis d'Appel d'Offres, codes/décrets/arrêtés/circulaires, standard bidding-document templates (DAO et rapport type), and a conciliation/arbitration track"} {:permit/source-shape :requirement-map, :permit/required-evidence ["EIN record" "SAM.gov registration record" "State business registration record" "Authorized-representative record"], :permit/ns "marketentry", :permit/repo "orgs/cloud-itonami/cloud-itonami-iso3166-com", :permit/legal-basis "Federal Acquisition Regulation (FAR); System for Award Management", :permit/jurisdiction "USA", :source/dataset "permits", :permit/provenance ["https://sam.gov/"], :permit/authority "U.S. General Services Administration (GSA) / SAM.gov", :permit/subject-key "USA", :permit/subject-name "United States", :permit/national-spec "SAM.gov entity registration + NAICS self-certification"} {:permit/source-shape :requirement-map, :permit/required-evidence ["Handelsregister extract" "e-Vergabe registration record" "USt-IdNr record" "Authorized-representative record"], :permit/ns "marketentry", :permit/repo "orgs/cloud-itonami/cloud-itonami-iso3166-com", :permit/legal-basis "Gesetz gegen Wettbewerbsbeschränkungen (GWB) / VgV", :permit/jurisdiction "DEU", :source/dataset "permits", :permit/provenance ["https://www.evergabe-online.de/"], :permit/authority "Beschaffungsamt des BMI / e-Vergabe platforms", :permit/subject-key "DEU", :permit/subject-name "Germany", :permit/national-spec "e-Vergabe supplier registration under EU procurement directives"} {:permit/source-shape :requirement-map, :permit/required-evidence ["DGRNI (Direção Geral dos Registos, Notariado e Identificação) commercial-registry / collective-entity registration confirmation, Decreto-Lei n.º 47/2016 (via Portal Empresa Online, peo.gov.cv, currently pilot/beta, or a Conservatória)" "DNRE (Direção Nacional de Receitas do Estado) Número de Identificação Fiscal (NIF) confirmation, Decreto-Lei n.º 89/2005, de 26 de dezembro (in-person registration at a Repartição de Finanças or Casa do Cidadão counter)" "eCompras/ePCV (epcv.gov.cv) supplier registration confirmation (ARAP-regulated, Ministério das Finanças)" "Confirmation the operator is not on ARAP's lista de entidades não elegíveis (Estatuto da ARAP, Decreto-lei nº 55/2015, Artigos 15.º(k)/17.º(c))" "Confirmation of authorized representative"], :permit/ns "marketentry", :permit/repo "orgs/cloud-itonami/cloud-itonami-iso3166-cpv", :permit/legal-basis "Código da Contratação Pública, aprovado pela Lei n.º 88/VIII/2015, de 14 de Abril -- cross-confirmed both in the Estatuto da ARAP's own preamble (OCR-read) and on ARAP's own 'Regulamentos' page", :permit/citations "{\"corporate-number\" {\"legal-basis\" \"Decreto-Lei n.º 89/2005, de 26 de dezembro (own primary text, DNRE's own NIF-request page): NIF (Número de Identificação Fiscal) registration is, as of this iteration's fetch, offered IN PERSON ONLY -- 'Serviço atualmente disponibilizado presencialmente, de forma gratuita, nos balcões das Repartições de Finanças e da Casa do Cidadão', via form Mod. 110 in duplicate -- NOT an online self-service system (an honest, explicit divergence from an assumed 'modern e-government' default)\", \"provenance\" \"https://www.mf.gov.cv/web/dnre ; https://www.mf.gov.cv/web/dnre/solicitar-nif\", \"owner-authority\" \"Direção Nacional de Receitas do Estado (DNRE), Ministério das Finanças\"}, \"contract-registration-fee\" {\"provenance\" \"https://www.arap.cv/images/centro_conhecimento/legislacao/decretos/ARAP_Estatutos.pdf ; https://www.arap.cv/index.php/competencia/regulamentar/regulamentos\", \"owner-authority\" \"Autoridade Reguladora das Aquisições Públicas (ARAP) -- Estatuto da ARAP's own Artigo 43.º(1)(b) 'Receitas'\", \"legal-basis\" \"Estatuto da ARAP (Decreto-lei nº 55/2015, de 9 de Outubro), Artigo 43.º(1)(b) (own primary text, OCR-read): a contract-registration fee ('emolumento') owed by the awarded contractor ('adjudicatário'), per the fee table set out in the statute's own Annex, referenced back by the Annex's own header ('a que se refere a alínea b) do nº 1 do artigo 43º do Estatuto da ARAP'). Own Annex table: contracts for lease/acquisition of movable goods and services, and public-works/concession contracts, valued up to 2,000,000 CVE are 'Isento' (EXEMPT); above that threshold a 0.5% registration fee applies. Consulting-services contracts instead use a 4,000,000 CVE band boundary with NO exemption tier documented at either side -- consulting contracts are never exempt regardless of value, a distinctive, honestly-scoped finding (see namespace docstring for the OCR confidence split on the rate figure vs. the threshold boundaries)\"}, \"business-registration\" {\"provenance\" \"https://justica.gov.cv/dgrni ; https://peo.gov.cv ; https://peo.gov.cv/criacaoempresa\", \"legal-basis\" \"Decreto-Lei n.º 47/2016, de 27 de setembro (own primary text via justica.gov.cv/dgrni's own page): establishes 'a estrutura, a organização e as normas de funcionamento do Ministério da Justiça'; DGRNI's own listed remit covers civil/property/motor-vehicle registry, 'registo comercial' (commercial registry) and the registry of collective/corporate entities. DGRNI operates the Portal Empresa Online (PEO, peo.gov.cv) one-stop digital company-registration service, but PEO's own site states it is in 'versão Beta' for a 'grupo piloto de utilizadores' only as of this iteration's fetch -- full public self-service company registration is not yet generally available, an honest, explicitly-flagged gap\", \"owner-authority\" \"Direção Geral dos Registos, Notariado e Identificação (DGRNI), a service of the Ministério da Justiça\"}}", :permit/jurisdiction "CPV", :source/dataset "permits", :permit/provenance ["https://www.arap.cv/" "https://www.arap.cv/index.php/competencia/regulamentar/regulamentos" "https://www.mf.gov.cv/web/ecompras" "https://epcv.gov.cv/plataforma/contratos/"], :permit/authority "Autoridade Reguladora das Aquisições Públicas (ARAP) -- an independent administrative authority, Ministry of Finance sector -- Estatuto da ARAP's own primary text (Decreto-lei nº 55/2015, de 9 de Outubro)", :permit/subject-key "CPV", :permit/subject-name "Republic of Cabo Verde", :permit/national-spec "eCompras (mf.gov.cv/web/ecompras, Ministério das Finanças) -- a live e-procurement information/on-boarding hub linking to the supplier-facing platform epcv.gov.cv (own text: 'plataforma de contratos públicos, adaptada às necessidades quer das entidades adjudicantes quer dos fornecedores'), with a live 'Aderir' supplier registration path and 'Procedimentos' tender-notice search; regulated by ARAP under the Código da Contratação Pública and its implementing decrees (Decreto-lei 46/2015 RUGA, Decreto-lei 50/2015 Regime Jurídico dos Contratos Administrativos)"} {:permit/source-shape :requirement-map, :permit/required-evidence ["EIN record" "SAM.gov registration record" "State business registration record" "Authorized-representative record"], :permit/ns "marketentry", :permit/repo "orgs/cloud-itonami/cloud-itonami-iso3166-cpv", :permit/legal-basis "Federal Acquisition Regulation (FAR); System for Award Management", :permit/jurisdiction "USA", :source/dataset "permits", :permit/provenance ["https://sam.gov/"], :permit/authority "U.S. General Services Administration (GSA) / SAM.gov", :permit/subject-key "USA", :permit/subject-name "United States", :permit/national-spec "SAM.gov entity registration + NAICS self-certification"} {:permit/source-shape :requirement-map, :permit/required-evidence ["Handelsregister extract" "e-Vergabe registration record" "USt-IdNr record" "Authorized-representative record"], :permit/ns "marketentry", :permit/repo "orgs/cloud-itonami/cloud-itonami-iso3166-cpv", :permit/legal-basis "Gesetz gegen Wettbewerbsbeschränkungen (GWB) / VgV", :permit/juri